{"4254900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Cursed Ward", "steam_appid": 4254900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/396697b786389157f25874a18a1818d0.avif?t=1782474635\" width=1068 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cursed Ward</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where survival depends on your observation. You are E-Class Personnel: Expendable. Your goal is to navigate 50 iterations of a medical ward and get out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LOOP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>: Navigate through 50 floors of increasing difficulty.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/d19da09015335b3686f1fa9da0bafa24.poster.avif?t=1782474635\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/d19da09015335b3686f1fa9da0bafa24.webm?t=1782474635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/d19da09015335b3686f1fa9da0bafa24.mp4?t=1782474635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retrieve</strong>: Find the Exit Codes required to unlock the next level.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/e521d0754f5d074b877d175cbf31dd0a.avif?t=1782474635\" width=400 height=224 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong>: Overcome a mix of deadly anomalies and psychological tricks.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/7e22e49d150d5daddf9084885294001a.poster.avif?t=1782474635\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/7e22e49d150d5daddf9084885294001a.webm?t=1782474635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/7e22e49d150d5daddf9084885294001a.mp4?t=1782474635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTERY &amp; FAIRNESS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge is Power</strong>: Every death is avoidable. Pay attention to your surroundings and read every note to understand the ward's logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Survival</strong>: Success isn't luck - it’s about learning the systems and maintaining focus under pressure.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/e38e18f576da7c7afcd4d7800469a68e.poster.avif?t=1782474635\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/e38e18f576da7c7afcd4d7800469a68e.webm?t=1782474635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/e38e18f576da7c7afcd4d7800469a68e.mp4?t=1782474635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Goal</strong>: Use what you’ve learned to conquer the ward in a single, deathless run.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Encounters</strong>: Hand-crafted threats distributed randomly - no two runs are the same.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/d99a88105256cdfb6a1ab0e986170a75.poster.avif?t=1782474635\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/d99a88105256cdfb6a1ab0e986170a75.webm?t=1782474635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/d99a88105256cdfb6a1ab0e986170a75.mp4?t=1782474635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System-Driven Horror</strong>: Not just a game, but a &quot;stress test&quot; of your focus and composure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Milestone Floors</strong>: Unique challenges waiting at key intervals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Built-in</strong>: Your runs are timed. Master the mechanics and share your best extraction times with friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay observant. Follow protocol. Don't die.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEHIND THE WARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a binational duo: a veteran IT professional with 20 years of experience and a Clinical Psychologist. The game’s &quot;stress test&quot; mechanics are designed using professional insights into psychological pressure and cognitive load.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254900/extras/396697b786389157f25874a18a1818d0.avif?t=1782474635\" width=1068 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cursed Ward</strong> is a first-person psychological horro